join Gogo (Neutral) left
join Hope (Neutral) right
update Gogo (Warm)
Gogo: That garden of yours will die of thirst if you let the dry season do the deciding.
- I don't know anything about irrigation
	Hope: I don't know anything about irrigation.
	Gogo: No reason you should. But someone here does.
	Gogo: Go and ask about drip lines. Tubing, fittings, the kind of scavenged parts a place like this always has lying around if you know whose door to knock on.
	set {GameState.quest_gogo_irrigation_referral} = "active"
	[signal arg="objective:Find the NPC Gogo has pointed toward and learn to build a drip system"]
- Could you show me?
	Hope: Could you show me?
	Gogo: I could. But my knees and a garden bed do not agree with each other anymore.
	Gogo: There is a difference between wisdom and knees. Go find someone with better knees.
	set {GameState.quest_gogo_irrigation_referral} = "active"
